      "description": "<p><strong>Update Changelog:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed an issue with eye adaptation being disabled causing the scene to be overly dark sometimes</li>\n<li>Added an option in f12 for manual exposure control when eye adaption is disabled</li>\n<li>Eye adaptation can now be enabled/disabled mid-raid</li>\n<li>Adjusted default terrain shadow density</li>\n<li>Added an option in f12 for manual control of shadow density</li>\n<li>Adjusted how ambient coloring works, should be less blue during day and darker at night</li>\n<li>Fixed an issue with cloud wind direction not actually being random at the start of each raid, it should work properly now</li>\n<li>Fixed an issue where during high cloud coverage, the top of some clouds would appear too dark</li>\n<li>Adjusted a few default shader values</li>\n</ul>\n",
