      "id": 13233,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "1.0.6",
      "description": "<p><strong>Update Changelog:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Changed where clouds are getting initiated</li>\n<li>Changed min and max cloud speed - cloud movement will be a lot more noticeable now especially during fast wind days</li>\n<li>Re-did a lot of coloring/timing on the clouds to have longer lasting sunsets/sunrises</li>\n<li>Night clouds have been improved</li>\n<li>Improved shading on clouds, they should appear like they have more depth now</li>\n<li>Overcast clouds improved, shouldn’t be blown out white anymore</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Keep in mind, a lot of the coloring and brightness also heavily relies on what your postfx settings are. These clouds were made with postfx disabled to have a base look to the clouds.</p>\n<p>Pictures (with my PostFx): <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/wIIcLDI\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/wIIcLDI</a></p>\n",
